  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biganda Coffee Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 620 smallholder farmers of whom 383 are women...Project funds will be used to pay for infrastructural development with construction of a central warehouse, procurement of equipment and materials for quality improvement, acquisition of motorcycles for extension work, training of farmers in modern coffee agronomic practices, and provision of working capital for buying coffee and farm inputs. Some of the funds will be used to build the capacity of staff to manage the cooperatives business better as well as for installation of IT equipment and financial systems. .</narrative>
  </description>
